{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"release"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLDivisions","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL12MXLDivisionsV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLNoteV7releaseAA12MXLDivisionsVSgvp","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"title":"release","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/release","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Alters the stopping time of the note from when it would otherwise occur, expressed in divisions. A note that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"starts a tie should not have a release attribute."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"release"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDivisions","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLDivisions","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL12MXLDivisionsV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps to the MusicXML "},{"code":"release","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote\/release"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLDivisions":{"title":"MXLDivisions","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "